---
import Link from "../ui/Link.astro";
import Note from "./Note.astro";
import Step from "./Step.astro";
import Terminal from "./Terminal.astro";

/**
 * Step 04: diagnostics for operators and agents, with the access caveat.
 * @example <Inspect />
 */
---

<Step id="inspect" number="04" label="Inspect / operators & agents">
  <div class="grid items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-stage-flip lg:gap-12">
    <div class="min-w-0 lg:order-2">
      <h2 id="inspect-title" class="mb-6 text-section font-medium">
        A running service.
        <br />
        Something to go on.
      </h2>
      <p class="mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Expose selected health, readiness, routes, and bounded traces, logs, and metrics as
        protected MCP tools. Operators and agents discover the same catalog.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Attach capture before startup and publish only the tools you intend to expose. Retained
        records are evidence, not a complete history.
      </p>
      <Link href="/docs/guides/observability/exposing-diagnostics">
        Publish selected diagnostics
      </Link>
    </div>
    <Terminal class="lg:order-1" title="Operator terminal" note="Command examples">
      <div class="p-4 text-xs text-muted sm:p-6">
        <p>
          First{" "}
          <a class="text-code-accent" href="/docs/guides/cli/connecting">
            connect and authenticate the CLI
          </a>
          . These commands assume default diagnostic groups.
        </p>
        <pre
          class="my-4 max-w-full overflow-x-auto font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-fg"
          tabindex="0"
          role="region"
          aria-label="Discover tools, wait for readiness, and inspect error traces"
        ><code><span class="text-muted"># Discover the actual catalog</span>
arkoren tools --json

<span class="text-muted"># Continue only if the wait succeeds</span>
arkoren app:ready --wait --timeout 30s

<span class="text-muted"># Inspect retained failed traces</span>
arkoren telemetry:traces --status error --since 5m</code></pre>
        <p>Failed waits exit nonzero. Actions are not automatically replayed.</p>
      </div>
    </Terminal>
  </div>
  <Note icon="shield">
    <strong class="font-medium text-fg">Exposure is an application decision.</strong> Authenticate
    callers and authorize resources. Even read-only diagnostics can contain private application
    data. <a href="/docs/guides/mcp/securing-mcp">Set the boundary.</a>
  </Note>
</Step>
